{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2ba9aaa85bc267f85826b069e0553860ba05f0c89db032332d78d759f7a526eb", "ja": "（映画の宣伝で、莉緒達がテレビの情報番組に\n出演することになった。そろそろ放送が始まるな）", "zh": "（为了宣传电影，莉绪她们前来参与\n电视台资讯节目的直播。现在差不多要开播了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "6d2992aa5434192b78087f9fbe9acff0c17079b81a9f090fb19f80403b88e29a", "ja": "{$P$}くん。\nそろそろ本番始まるけど、なにかあるかしら？", "zh": "{$P$}，\n差不多要正式开始了，你有什么要提醒的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1002_p", "source_sha256": "38a2f4840adefe25ab91d457a1e352d059e11af6e3507990a7f81573a94a42b1", "ja": "そうだな、特には……あ、いや、ひとつあったか。\n莉緒、今日は控えめにな！", "zh": "这个嘛，没什么……啊不，有一件事。\n莉绪，你今天要收敛点啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "b37857d8111b0c360b205f9a61fc6d8b827c03f041e360e2759e925fc94aeef4", "ja": "ちょっと、{$P$}くん？　せっかく\n映画の宣伝で来たのに、控えめってどういうコト？", "zh": "喂，我说{$P$}，\n今天就是来宣传电影的，你怎么要我收敛点啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "95f94a497d1290f76ca653626594612b5b87e1625130f6cd86d403c4fbc0f483", "ja": "私、いつもよりサービスしちゃおうと思ってたのよ！\n劇場の宣伝にもなりそうだし……。", "zh": "我原本还想说要给观众多一点福利耶！\n这样感觉也能替剧场打广告……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a7deff3939be8597c1877e941db5099876a5a72542b3ea3030abeacc288902fc", "ja": "そうなんだけど、お昼の生放送だし。\n莉緒が本気を出すと、刺激的すぎるからな。", "zh": "话是这么说没错，但这节目是在白天的直播。\n莉绪要是认真起来，观众会招架不住的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "0e267dc1044f178292a930513f67e0d9231cba3262d89dd36f42b77ed0edd67e", "ja": "あら、いいじゃないの刺激的！\n刺激的なほうが、宣伝になると思うわよ？", "zh": "哎呀，刺激一点不是很好吗！\n我觉得越是刺激，宣传效果就越好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1007_p", "source_sha256": "fee69857d53e1ef03743629aa7d67bf55fc6ce861f63f1d3e3d5ec7347fd6da2", "ja": "いや、時と場合によるから……今回の映画は\nそういう内容じゃないし、そういう役でもないから。", "zh": "不，那也要看时间跟场合……\n这次的电影并不是那种内容，你演的也不是那种角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1008_staff", "source_sha256": "2edfd6e73bac60ff1e63e307778220898388b8e234d0a57592eed65b7640b2ff", "ja": "百瀬さん、スタンバイお願いしまーす！", "zh": "百濑小姐，差不多该准备上场了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "bae5f27be012d74f02f7c24f89b889eee1c871a0363ecc13543bc2358dac226e", "ja": "あ、はーい♪　じゃあ、いってくるわね。\nまあ、お姉さんに任せておきなさいって！", "zh": "啊，好的──♪那我要过去啰。\n你就放心交给姊姊我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1010_p", "source_sha256": "feff0213096ffde7c20f450466c1499fa131ed5366b17e848b7dd34c609f0aef", "ja": "あっ、莉緒……！\n行っちゃったけど、大丈夫かな……。", "zh": "啊，莉绪……！\n就这样走掉了，没问题吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1011_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "5be7385c4d170c56d2c9cd504861aaf9f52d71e2e971fc3e4ea5d76fb5dd4886", "ja": "それでは次に、百瀬莉緒さん。\nずばり、この映画の見どころを教えてください！", "zh": "那接着有请百濑莉绪小姐。\n麻烦直截了当地告诉我们这部电影的看头是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "2e3bf00851441334a965deebb4dedd34a87b3026b4c35d8095524b0fed28052d", "ja": "ウフフ♪　見どころですって？\nそれはもちろん、セクシーな私の脚線美……。", "zh": "呵呵♪你说看头啊？\n那当然是我这双美腿的性感线条……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1013_p", "source_sha256": "eae8311581882188db6ed5fc5ec080a49b6b3aa0c42ed6d97ee1e34c9d9c2b68", "ja": "（莉緒ー！）", "zh": "（莉绪──！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "4aeef5df3d3e6d7ba0876ee4d81a65400c506a75a43176ae50425ebca75993df", "ja": "……と、言いたいところだけど。私、見てのとおり\nイケメン役なの。だからセクシーはお・あ・ず・け♪", "zh": "……虽然很想这么说，但就如各位所见，\n我演的是一个帅哥，所以性感镜头就下、次、再、说♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "85ffa41b7eb6160901f80e0bd7c97640a9b841a5bb412f4f57aeded8e111181c", "ja": "やっぱり一番の魅力は、心温まるストーリーかしら？\nそれと、私たちアイドルの熱演にも注目ね。", "zh": "电影最大的魅力我想还是在温馨的故事上吧？\n当然，大家也要关注我们偶像的卖力演出喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1016_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "ca558b4774111c770a7fcb39f36ba5d03298f1f9313ada6d91d1303010ef18f7", "ja": "なるほど！　百瀬さんは今回、\nイケメン役を熱演されたと。これは楽しみですね！", "zh": "原来如此！百濑小姐这次是饰演一名帅哥啊，\n真叫人期待你精彩的演技！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "d560294f9296cb6b2f1c1e8af1586022f79c8f03730eb2a37be4ddc6644731e8", "ja": "ええ、そう！　私の役は、歌織ちゃんの演じた\n一夏と同級生だった、悠利っていうんだけど……。", "zh": "没有错！我这个角色跟小歌演的一夏是同学，\n名字叫做悠利……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1018_046rio", "source_sha256": "771e9bcf9fb7ac04d32aeb8417149449bd000fd157c9ddab82834b6d9f6e3666", "ja": "切ない想いを抱えた、とっても素敵な男の子なの。\nみんな、どうか楽しみにしててね！", "zh": "他是一个胸怀悲切心思、非常棒的男生。\n请各位期待电影的上映喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1019_046rio", "source_sha256": "58589cdd99048a92f48b43a3c2e2fd8ca1da12f3ca5a2d078976103f43a9bc02", "ja": "それと……キレイなお姉さんの私が見たい子は、\n765プロ劇場まで来てね？　待ってるわ、ウフフ♪", "zh": "另外……如果有孩子想看我美丽大姊姊的一面，\n就到765艺能剧场来吧，等你们哦，呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1020_046rio", "source_sha256": "e85bf30988e2eb9fe3078670bb965de279cee3c20fb3ca4441e77f8c8c038fe9", "ja": "ふぅ……お疲れさま、{$P$}くん。\nあんな感じで、どうだったかしら？", "zh": "呼……辛苦了，{$P$}。\n刚刚的表现你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1021_p", "source_sha256": "de80ef964a2260a3680f551d36a4ee0820fe315421fde2c4f12e01932a84e662", "ja": "ああ、お疲れさま！\nすごいな、完ぺきだったじゃないか。", "zh": "嗯，辛苦了！\n你真厉害，简直完美无缺啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1022_046rio", "source_sha256": "8056d9366e65de9b62c6af2435483da5de67bc3ddc9173637a224eeffccbe530", "ja": "ウフフ、よかった♪\n私としては、ちょっと物足りなかったけど……。", "zh": "呵呵，太好了♪\n我自己是觉得有点不满足……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1023_046rio", "source_sha256": "63a5cc40b6773ccdf47c6e557cd2b77f99b6547b72d5b9ec8d70af3fc1b582d2", "ja": "でも今日は、映画の宣伝に来たんだしね。\n私だけ目立っても意味がないもの。", "zh": "但今天是来宣传电影的，\n我一个人出尽风头也没有意义。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1024_046rio", "source_sha256": "357b03ef201f9fecaa8f4b750e8873e3ce0db953574dbde488dc750d26271ac7", "ja": "何しろ今回は、私たちみんなで頑張った\n最高の映画なんだから。……でしょ？", "zh": "毕竟这可是我们几个尽善尽美、\n合力打造出来的电影……你说是吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1025_p", "source_sha256": "86f2cf0257e1003da9a0a433165e0a5373a21b3b61b1da6c521d49ecfc79830e", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\nちゃんと考えてくれてありがとう、莉緒。", "zh": "嗯，没有错。\n谢谢你有考虑到大家，莉绪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1026_046rio", "source_sha256": "0945d8f56fb0aad8c7e1fd87c8463be801810d25ab6bf97e76e1b2c9f1fbb34a", "ja": "これくらい、当然でしょ？\nあ、でもお礼がしたいってことなら……。", "zh": "这点小事是当然的。\n啊，如果你想道谢的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1027_046rio", "source_sha256": "2146ed9db5e2c6fcba51f44cb849b09a455eb9485eea1c48ec45d8f9a2d5d4c2", "ja": "朝までゆっくり、過ごしたいわね？\nふ・た・り・き・り・で……♪", "zh": "我想要悠悠哉哉地过一晚呢，\n就、我、们、两、个……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1028_p", "source_sha256": "5867b35d0f11ddf5a2a45651e0683b62483039bd1bb37a6ababcbf2121d26ff4", "ja": "それは……。", "zh": "你的意思是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1029_046rio", "source_sha256": "2bedbcf10d036e6a9e25df004e83c9546986eb74ff9c81720facbd6ceab8c56f", "ja": "そう！　美味しいお店、見つけたのよ～！\nさっそく今晩、どう？", "zh": "没错！我发现了一家不错的店～！\n干脆就今晚，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1030_p", "source_sha256": "cf279aeb87c51cb67d44cb431b8179eeaf8b60fd4f26df5635a1882fea882752", "ja": "やっぱり。\n明日が早いから、今日は遠慮しておこうかな。", "zh": "我就知道。\n明天还要早起，今天就先算了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0084_1031_046rio", "source_sha256": "34bd4076d9f859748d40021c7f5a1f5d00d713c8ce62a0c16e0e3df50dd66b0c", "ja": "あん、もう！\n{$P$}くんのイジワル～！", "zh": "唉唷，讨厌！\n{$P$}就爱欺负人～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
